  ('rc4088-rev23', '3700', 'Dividends declared', 'Retained earnings', true, false, 'liquidating dividends, premium paid on redemption of shares, and stock dividends declared on shares GIFI-Short: Also include all amounts here that would have otherwise been reported under items 3701 and 3702.'),
