  ('rc4088-rev23', '8000', 'Trade sales of goods and services', 'Revenue', true, false, 'For corporations or partnerships who are not involved in the resource industry (items 8040 to 8053) or the fishing industry (items 8160 to 8166), but whose main source of income is the sale of a product or service. Amounts may be reported net of discounts allowed on sales, sales rebates, volume discounts, returns, and allowances.'),
