  ('rc4088-rev23', '8210', 'Realized gains/losses on disposal of assets', 'Revenue', true, false, 'gain/loss or profit/loss on disposal/sale of capital assets GIFI-Short: Also include amounts under items 8211 and 8212, as well as book gains or losses, gain or loss on disposal of fixed assets, and recaptured depreciation.'),
